  "description": "A managed, cross-platform music engraving engine for .NET: LilyPond .ly notation source in, SVG pages and Standard MIDI Files out, entirely in process — parser, Scheme layer, engravers, page layout and embedded music and text fonts, with no native libraries to install. Includes convert-ly and the ABC, MIDI and MusicXML importers. Licensed GPL-3.0-only (not -or-later); referencing this package makes the consuming application a GPL-3.0 work.",
